Feature: Audio click
  As a musician using the metronome TUI
  I want an audible click on every beat, accented on beat 1
  So that I can hear the tempo without watching the screen

  Background:
    Given the metronome app has started

  @ft:71
  Scenario: A click plays on every beat while playing
    Given the metronome is playing
    When  beat 2 is struck
    Then  a click should be triggered
    When  beat 3 is struck
    Then  a click should be triggered

  @ft:72
  Scenario: Beat 1's click is accented
    Given the metronome is playing
    When  beat 1 is struck
    Then  an accented click should be triggered

  @ft:73
  Scenario: Beats 2 through 4's clicks are not accented
    Given the metronome is playing
    When  beat 2 is struck
    Then  a non-accented click should be triggered
    When  beat 3 is struck
    Then  a non-accented click should be triggered
    When  beat 4 is struck
    Then  a non-accented click should be triggered

  @ft:74
  Scenario: No click is triggered while stopped
    Given the metronome is stopped
    Then  no click should be triggered

  @ft:75
  Scenario: Audio failures are silent
    Given audio playback is unavailable (no device)
    And   the metronome is playing
    When  beat 1 is struck
    Then  no error should be shown
    And   the metronome should continue running visual-only
